message: "If you use SPECS in your work, please cite the ECOC 2023 paper given as the preferred citation."
type: software
title: "SPECS: Scalable Photonic Event-driven Circuit Simulator"
abstract: >-
  SPECS is an event-driven photonic circuit simulator built on SystemC, with a SPICE-like netlist
  language, for fast, femtosecond-accurate simulation of large photonic circuits.
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
